title Cassette recordings list with the LOAD action: idle (Take 006 highlighted, LOAD first of the four keys) and previewing (Enter on Take 005: the preview plays; Enter again stops it and rewinds; Esc stops it)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
expect text "LOAD"
expect text "RENAME"
expect text "TRIM"
expect text "DELETE"
shot list-load-idle
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
wait 200
key enter
wait 300
shot list-load-previewing
expect text "LOAD"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
say Enter on Take 005: the preview plays (list_activate)
key enter
wait 300
say Enter on the previewing row again: the preview stops and rewinds
key enter
wait 300
say Enter again: it previews again
key esc
wait 400
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 006 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
@320x480 expect text "WAV 48k"
@320x480 expect notext "TAKE 006"
say Esc closed the list: the preview stopped, the loaded Take 006 is in the deck
expect noquit
